# Configure Microtik cAP via Ansible
## Prepartion
### Set static IP for Ethernet on PC in samme network
`sudo ip addr add 192.168.0.100/24 dev enp0s25`

### Install Ansible
`sudo apt update -y && sudo apt install ansible -y`
### Install Ansible modules for Microtik
`ansible-galaxy collection install community.network`
### Make dir *microtik-cAP*
`mkdir ~/microtik-cAP`
## Configure targets
### Create target list
`nano ~/microtik-cAP/hosts.ini`
### Add Microtik cAP into Invertory list
```
[mikrotik_cAP]
192.168.0.107 ansible_user=admin ansible_ssh_pass="" ansible_network_os=community.network.routeros ansible_connection=ansible.netcommon.network_cli
```

  * `192.168.0.107` - target IP Address for SSH
  * `ansible_user=admin` - login for Microtik
  * `ansible_ssh_pass=""` - password for Microtik